  "performance": {"required": true, "baselineFactor": 10},
  "hints": ["Keep the home team's lead as you read the sheet: up one for a 1, down one for a 0. If the lead is the same at two moments, the goals between them are shared equally.", "Remember, in a map, the first position where each lead was seen. Before any goal the lead is 0: PUT that in the map as position -1.", "At each goal, GET the lead from the map. IF it IS NOT NOTHING, the run from there to here is level: keep the longest. ELSE PUT the lead with this position. Never overwrite a lead you have already stored."],
